workedExamples.question_text:
Calculate the volume of this hemisphere of radius $4.5$ cm, correct to $2$ decimal places.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[draw=black,text=black,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\draw (0,0) ellipse (1.8 and 0.45);
\draw (-1.8,0) arc[start angle=180,end angle=360,x radius=1.8,y radius=1.8];
\fill (0,0) circle (1.2pt);
\draw[->] (0,0)--(1.8,0);
\path (0.9,0) node[above=3pt] {$4.5\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

A bowl is a hemisphere of diameter $13$ cm. Find its volume, correct to the nearest cubic centimetre.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[draw=black,text=black,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\draw (0,0) ellipse (1.8 and 0.45);
\draw (-1.8,0) arc[start angle=180,end angle=360,x radius=1.8,y radius=1.8];
\draw[<->] (-1.8,0.8)--(1.8,0.8);
\path (0,0.8) node[above=3pt] {$13\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

